helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091400.xhp	0	help	par_id3147570				0	ne	 कोष्ठकहरू "left" वा "right"द्वारा विस्तारित, तथापि, जहिले पनि तर्कमा समायोजन हुन्छ. हेर्नुहोस् "left(left(left(a right)right)right)", "left(stack{a#b#c}right)", "left(a over b right)."				2002-02-02 02:02:02
