helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153678				0	ne	To edit a frame, click the border to select it, and then choose \<emph\>Format - Frame\</emph\>. You can also resize or move a selected frame using special \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04130100.xhp\" name=\"shortcut keys\"\>shortcut keys\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
