helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155918	36			0	ne	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:NUMERICFIELD:RID_SVXPAGE_EXT_PARAGRAPH:ED_WIDOWS\"\>Specifies the minimum number of lines in a paragraph in the first page after the break. Select this check box, and then enter a number in the \<emph\>Lines \</emph\>box.\</ahelp\> If the number of lines at the top of the page is less than the amount specified in the \<emph\>Lines \</emph\>box, the position of the break is adjusted.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
