helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149352				0	ne	You can select from predefined column layouts, or create your own. When you apply a layout to a page style, all pages that use the style are updated. Similarly, when you apply a column layout to a frame style, all frames that use that style are updated. You can also change the column layout for a single frame.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149485				0	ne	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_TP_COLUMN_LB_POSITION\"\>बिभाजक लाइनको ठाडो पङ्क्तिबद्धता चयन गर्नुहोस्। यो विकल्प यदि लाइनको \<emph\>उचाइ\</emph\> मान १०० % भन्दा कम भएमा मात्र उपलब्ध हुन्छ।\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
