helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060900.xhp	0	help	par_id3149485				0	ne	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_TP_FRM_ADD_LB_NEXT\"\>Displays the item (object, graphic, or frame) that comes after the current item in a linked sequence. To add or change the next link, select a name from the list. If you are a linking frames, the target frame must be empty.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
